{"seq":4,"slug":"stash-and-worktree","title":"暂存与工作树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/stash-and-worktree","wordCount":755,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"暂存与工作树\">暂存与工作树</h1><h2 id=\"git-stash-暂存\">Git Stash 暂存</h2><p><strong>Stash（暂存）</strong> 允许你将当前工作目录和暂存区的更改临时保存起来，恢复到干净的工作状态，稍后再恢复继续工作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git stash&#10;git stash push -m &quot;WIP: refactor auth module&quot;&#10;&#10;git stash list&#10;&#10;git stash show -p stash@{0}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"WIP: refactor auth module\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这一组工具都在管理&quot;工作区状态&quot;，但适用的时间尺度不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暂存</td>\n<td>把未完成的更改临时收起，随时恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分暂存</td>\n<td>只收起部分文件或部分修改块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作树</td>\n<td>在同一仓库下并行检出多个分支到不同目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象共享</td>\n<td>多个工作树共享同一份 .git 对象数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理</td>\n<td>删除未被跟踪的文件，使工作区回到干净状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"stash-操作详解\">Stash 操作详解</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>git stash</code></td>\n<td>暂存已跟踪文件的更改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git stash -u</code></td>\n<td>同时暂存未跟踪文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git stash -a</code></td>\n<td>暂存所有文件（含 .gitignore）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git stash pop</code></td>\n<td>恢复最近的 stash 并删除记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git stash apply</code></td>\n<td>恢复最近的 stash 但保留记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git stash drop stash@{n}</code></td>\n<td>删除指定 stash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git stash clear</code></td>\n<td>清空所有 stash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git stash branch &lt;name&gt;</code></td>\n<td>从 stash 创建新分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git stash push -m &quot;halfway done with feature&quot; -u&#10;git checkout hotfix-branch&#10;# ... 完成紧急修复 ...&#10;git checkout feature-branch&#10;git stash pop\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"halfway done with feature\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hotfix-branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ... 完成紧急修复 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature-branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pop</span></span></code></pre></div><p>从 stash 创建分支（当 stash 与当前分支冲突时特别有用）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git stash branch new-feature stash@{0}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new-feature</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>git stash pop</code> 在恢复失败（冲突）时不会删除 stash 记录，你需要手动解决冲突后使用 <code>git stash drop</code> 清理。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"部分暂存\">部分暂存</h2><p>使用交互式暂存可以只保存部分文件或部分修改：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git stash push -p&#10;&#10;git stash push -- src/auth.sh src/config.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/auth.sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[工作区有多处修改] --&gt; B{需要全部暂存?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[git stash]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[git stash -p]&#10;    D --&gt; E[逐个 hunk 选择]&#10;    E --&gt; F[y/n/s/q]\">graph LR\n    A[工作区有多处修改] --&gt; B{需要全部暂存?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[git stash]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[git stash -p]\n    D --&gt; E[逐个 hunk 选择]\n    E --&gt; F[y/n/s/q]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-worktree-多工作目录\">Git Worktree 多工作目录</h2><p><strong>Worktree（工作树）</strong> 允许在同一个仓库下同时检出多个分支到不同的目录，避免频繁的分支切换和 stash。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git worktree add ../hotfix-work hotfix/urgent&#10;git worktree add ../release-v2 release/v2.0&#10;&#10;git worktree list&#10;&#10;git worktree remove ../hotfix-work\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> worktree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ../hotfix-work</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hotfix/urgent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> worktree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ../release-v2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release/v2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> worktree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> worktree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ../hotfix-work</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>stash</th>\n<th>worktree</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工作方式</td>\n<td>保存/恢复更改</td>\n<td>创建独立工作目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行开发</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持多分支同时工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘占用</td>\n<td>无额外占用</td>\n<td>需要额外目录空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>临时中断当前工作</td>\n<td>需要长时间并行开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象共享</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>共享 .git 对象数据库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[主仓库 .git] --&gt; W1[worktree: main]&#10;    R --&gt; W2[worktree: hotfix]&#10;    R --&gt; W3[worktree: release]&#10;    W1 -.-&gt; |共享对象| R&#10;    W2 -.-&gt; |共享对象| R&#10;    W3 -.-&gt; |共享对象| R\">graph TD\n    R[主仓库 .git] --&gt; W1[worktree: main]\n    R --&gt; W2[worktree: hotfix]\n    R --&gt; W3[worktree: release]\n    W1 -.-&gt; |共享对象| R\n    W2 -.-&gt; |共享对象| R\n    W3 -.-&gt; |共享对象| R</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Worktree 非常适合在修复紧急 bug 时不想丢失当前开发进度的场景，比 stash 更适合需要长时间处理的并行任务。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-clean-清理\">Git Clean 清理</h2><p><strong>git clean</strong> 用于删除工作目录中未被 Git 跟踪的文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git clean -n&#10;git clean -f&#10;git clean -fd&#10;git clean -fx&#10;&#10;git clean -i\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>-n</code></td>\n<td>干运行，只显示将被删除的文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-f</code></td>\n<td>强制删除未跟踪文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-d</code></td>\n<td>同时删除未跟踪的目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-x</code></td>\n<td>同时删除被 .gitignore 忽略的文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-X</code></td>\n<td>只删除被 .gitignore 忽略的文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-i</code></td>\n<td>交互模式，逐个确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 执行 <code>git clean -f</code> 前务必先用 <code>-n</code> 预览，删除操作不可逆。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战场景组合\">实战场景组合</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 场景 1：紧急切换分支&#10;git stash push -m &quot;WIP: feature-x&quot; -u&#10;git checkout hotfix/critical&#10;# ... 修复 ...&#10;git checkout feature-x&#10;git stash pop&#10;&#10;# 场景 2：并行开发两个功能&#10;git worktree add ../feature-a feature/a&#10;git worktree add ../feature-b feature/b&#10;# 在两个目录中独立开发&#10;&#10;# 场景 3：清理构建产物&#10;git clean -fdX&#10;&#10;# 场景 4：完全重置到干净状态&#10;git checkout -- .&#10;git clean -fd\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景 1：紧急切换分支</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"WIP: feature-x\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hotfix/critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ... 修复 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature-x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景 2：并行开发两个功能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> worktree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ../feature-a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> worktree</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ../feature-b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在两个目录中独立开发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景 3：清理构建产物</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fdX</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景 4：完全重置到干净状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clean</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fd</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((暂存与工作树))&#10;    Stash&#10;      push / pop / apply&#10;      部分暂存 -p&#10;      stash branch&#10;    Worktree&#10;      多工作目录&#10;      共享对象数据库&#10;      并行开发&#10;    Clean&#10;      -n 预览&#10;      -f 删除&#10;      -x 含忽略文件&#10;    实战组合&#10;      紧急切换&#10;      并行任务&#10;      环境清理\">mindmap\n  root((暂存与工作树))\n    Stash\n      push / pop / apply\n      部分暂存 -p\n      stash branch\n    Worktree\n      多工作目录\n      共享对象数据库\n      并行开发\n    Clean\n      -n 预览\n      -f 删除\n      -x 含忽略文件\n    实战组合\n      紧急切换\n      并行任务\n      环境清理</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Stash</strong> 是临时保存工作进度的首选工具，支持部分暂存和从 stash 创建分支</li>\n<li><strong>Worktree</strong> 实现真正的并行开发，多个工作目录共享同一个 Git 对象数据库</li>\n<li><strong>Clean</strong> 用于清理未跟踪文件，<code>-n</code> 预览是使用前的必要步骤</li>\n<li>根据中断时长选择工具：短暂中断用 <strong>stash</strong>，长期并行用 <strong>worktree</strong></li>\n<li>组合使用这三个工具可以在复杂的多任务场景下保持工作区的整洁有序</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"暂存与工作树","id":"暂存与工作树"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Stash 暂存","id":"git-stash-暂存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Stash 操作详解","id":"stash-操作详解"},{"level":2,"text":"部分暂存","id":"部分暂存"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Worktree 多工作目录","id":"git-worktree-多工作目录"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Clean 清理","id":"git-clean-清理"},{"level":2,"text":"实战场景组合","id":"实战场景组合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合并与变基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/merge-and-rebase"},"next":{"title":"交互式变基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/interactive-rebase"}}